{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfad A JOURNEY ON THE BOUNDARIES OF REALITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Brothers Hotel</i> offers a psychological horror experience where lost memories, dark secrets, and twisted realities intertwine. As Gabriel, you find yourself trapped in the labyrinthine corridors of an abandoned mental hospital. This place was once a luxurious hotel... <strong>until the crimes etched on the walls and the silent screams turned it into a cursed legacy.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfda\ufe0f MORE THAN JUST A HOTEL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gabriel arrived at this structure, carrying traces of the past, believing in his identity as a <i>&quot;graffiti artist.&quot;</i> However, what he is about to discover is much <strong>darker</strong> than a simple art passion. The walls of the hotel are filled with traces of secret organizations involving rich and powerful names, missing individuals, and unexplained events. With each step, pieces leaking from Gabriel's memory turn into a puzzle playing with reality:<br>&quot;Why do I feel so familiar with this place? \ud83e\udd14&quot;<br>Are these sounds... Are these images... Are they mine?&quot;[/i]</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd2a REALITY OR NIGHTMARE?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mental Collapse</strong>: Memory loss, hallucinations, and <i>blurring the lines between reality and imagination</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Confessions</strong>: In the depths of the hotel, you will discover pieces of Gabriel's past. <strong>But what if what you learn scares you?</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Escape</strong>: Some doors should not be opened. Some truths should <i>never be known</i>.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae GAMEPLAY EXPERIENCE</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power of Graffiti</strong>: Open hidden passages by painting the walls, but every brushstroke will awaken <strong>dark secrets of the past</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Puzzles</strong>: Dynamic mechanics that challenge your intellect and intuition.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Horror</strong>: Feel the tension to your core with real-time sound design and visual illusions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cost of Choices</strong>: Every action you take will <strong>permanently</strong> alter the course of the story.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2753 FINAL QUESTION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Is Gabriel truly an artist... or the <i>most horrifying secret</i> of the hotel?</strong><br><i>The only way to find the answer: Step inside.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to The Brothers Hotel.<br>No way out. </strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome to Brother's Hotel...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3443410/ca9e5302556a3392a88d9b03cfb624389fe75115.jpg"},{"name":"Way down we go\u2026","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3443410/cbdcbb6cc352f98a4986e4548b969db9a7121d12.jpg"},{"name":"Literally! Who build this place!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3443410/89f63de4be833fe88fd3a256ca33ae31d30972bb.jpg"},{"name":"Somewhere safe i guess..","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3443410/ab4e7b4ebe9ba65d51e204b7ab7dca5a18b58b19.jpg"},{"name":"Not a great picnic place!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3443410/495d17de857735699987f4982a71bd6ab887e9f5.jpg"},{"name":"To be, or not to be.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3443410/eee0c7e5389009c7913eef1bdf724949ff91e74